      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "또 만났네요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n포켓몬으로부터 얻을 수 있는 재료로\n향수를 조합하는 조향사예요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B6100020B9CCB0ACB124C694002100100001BE01000AD3ECCF13BAACC73CB85CBD80D1300020C5BBC7440020C2180020C788B2940020C7ACB8CCB85C000AD5A5C218B97C0020C870D569D558B2940020C870D5A5C0ACC608C694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "실은 또 새로운 향수에 대한 아이디어가\n떠올랐거든요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2E4C7400020B6100020C0C8B85CC6B40020D5A5C218C5D00020B300D55C0020C544C774B514C5B4AC00000AB5A0C62CB790AC70B4E0C694002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이번 목표는 바로\n바닐프티가 뿜어내는 하얀 눈!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BC880020BAA9D45CB2940020BC14B85C000ABC14B2D0D504D2F0AC000020BFDCC5B4B0B4B2940020D558C5800020B208002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "소프트아이스크림처럼\n새하얗고 폭신폭신한 바닐프티...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n무슨 냄새가 날까요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C18CD504D2B8C544C774C2A4D06CB9BCCC98B7FC000AC0C8D558C597ACE00020D3EDC2E0D3EDC2E0D55C0020BC14B2D0D504D2F0002E002E002E00100001BE00000ABB34C2A80020B0C4C0C8AC000020B0A0AE4CC694002E002E002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "괜찮으시다면 바닐프티를\n데려와 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD1CCC2EC73CC2DCB2E4BA740020BC14B2D0D504D2F0B97C000AB370B824C6400020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바닐프티를 지닌 포켓몬에 넣고\n데려와 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14B2D0D504D2F0B97C0020C9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020B123ACE0000AB370B824C6400020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바닐프티를 데려와 주셨군요!\n감사합니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14B2D0D504D2F0B97C0020B370B824C6400020C8FCC168AD70C6940021000AAC10C0ACD569B2C8B2E4002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼 바로 바닐프티의 눈을\n한 꼬집만 실례할게요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC0020BC14B85C0020BC14B2D0D504D2F0C7580020B208C744000AD55C0020AF2CC9D1B9CC0020C2E4B840D560AC8CC694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앗, 차가워! 역시 영하 50도의\n숨결을 내뱉는 포켓몬이네.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C557002C0020CC28AC00C6CC00210020C5EDC2DC0020C601D558002000350030B3C4C758000AC228ACB0C7440020B0B4BC49B2940020D3ECCF13BAACC774B124002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보통 눈은 아무 냄새도 나지 않지만\n포켓몬의 눈은 뭔가 다를 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF4D1B50020B208C7400020C544BB340020B0C4C0C8B3C40020B098C9C00020C54AC9C0B9CC000AD3ECCF13BAACC7580020B208C7400020BB54AC000020B2E4B97C0020AC70C608C694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바닐프티 향수가\n완성됐어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14B2D0D504D2F00020D5A5C218AC00000AC644C131B410C5B4C694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "놀랍게도 바닐프티의 눈에서는\n은은하게 달콤~한 향기가 나는 거 있죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B180B78DAC8CB3C40020BC14B2D0D504D2F0C7580020B208C5D0C11CB294000AC740C740D558AC8C0020B2ECCF64007ED55C0020D5A5AE30AC000020B098B2940020AC700020C788C8E0002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다만 이 향기를 맡고 있으면 신기하게도\n몸이 금방 서늘해지는 기분이에요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4B9CC0020C7740020D5A5AE30B97C0020B9E1ACE00020C788C73CBA740020C2E0AE30D558AC8CB3C4000ABAB8C7740020AE08BC290020C11CB298D574C9C0B2940020AE30BD84C774C5D0C694002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇다는 건!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807B2E4B2940020AC74002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "열대인 알로라지방에서 인기 있지 않을까요?\n포켓몬 향수의 가능성이 보였어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5F4B300C7780020C54CB85CB77CC9C0BC29C5D0C11C0020C778AE300020C788C9C00020C54AC744AE4CC694003F000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020D5A5C218C7580020AC00B2A5C131C7740020BCF4C600C5B4C694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 향수의 가능성은 무궁무진하네요!\n다음에도 잘 부탁드릴게요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
